<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Smart Education</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        .container {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #667eea;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .title {
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .content {
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }
        .button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .feature {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .role-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #667eea;
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 15px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-left: 10px;
        }
        .role-student { background-color: #28a745; }
        .role-teacher { background-color: #ffc107; color: #333; }
        .role-admin { background-color: #dc3545; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">🎓 Smart Education</div>
            <h1 class="title">Welcome to Smart Education!</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi <strong><%= fullName %></strong><span class="role-badge role-<%= role %>"><%= role %></span>,</p>
            
            <p>🎉 Congratulations! Your email has been successfully verified and your Smart Education account is now active!</p>
            
            <p>You're now ready to start your learning journey with us. Here's what you can do next:</p>
            
            <div class="feature-grid">
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📚</div>
                    <h3>Explore Courses</h3>
                    <p>Browse our extensive library of courses and find the perfect learning path for you.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">👥</div>
                    <h3>Join Community</h3>
                    <p>Connect with fellow learners, ask questions, and share your knowledge.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
                    <h3>Track Progress</h3>
                    <p>Monitor your learning progress and celebrate your achievements.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🏆</div>
                    <h3>Earn Certificates</h3>
                    <p>Complete courses and earn recognized certificates to showcase your skills.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <% if (role === 'student') { %>
            <p><strong>As a Student, you can:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Enroll in courses and track your progress</li>
                <li>Participate in discussions and forums</li>
                <li>Access learning materials and resources</li>
                <li>Earn certificates upon course completion</li>
                <li>Connect with teachers and other students</li>
            </ul>
            <% } %>
            
            <% if (role === 'teacher') { %>
            <p><strong>As a Teacher, you can:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Create and manage your own courses</li>
                <li>Upload learning materials and resources</li>
                <li>Interact with students and answer questions</li>
                <li>Track student progress and performance</li>
                <li>Access teaching tools and analytics</li>
            </ul>
            <% } %>
            
            <% if (role === 'admin') { %>
            <p><strong>As an Admin, you can:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Access the admin dashboard</li>
                <li>Manage users, courses, and content</li>
                <li>View system analytics and reports</li>
                <li>Moderate discussions and content</li>
                <li>Configure system settings</li>
            </ul>
            <% } %>
            
            <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
                <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="button">Get Started Now</a>
            </div>
            
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to our support team.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Happy Learning!<br><strong>Smart Education Team</strong></p>
            <p>This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
            <p>© 2024 Smart Education. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
